 "note": "GAFO (general merchandise, apparel and accessories, furniture, and other) is a Census grouping of stores that sell department-store-type goods: furniture and home furnishings (NAICS 442), electronics and appliances (443), clothing and accessories (448), sporting goods, hobby, musical instrument and book (451), general merchandise (452), and office supply, stationery and gift stores (4532). Used merchandise stores (4533), such as thrift, consignment and antique shops, are not part of GAFO. Share = sum of the last 12 months of used merchandise sales divided by the sum of the last 12 months of GAFO sales, both in nominal dollars. Excludes online resale platforms. Latest month (Sep 2026) is preliminary.",
